WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.705 --> 00:00:15.068
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> She’s beautiful.

2
00:00:16.848 --> 00:00:18.512
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hi, Izzy.

3
00:00:22.441 --> 00:00:23.874
Thanks for coming.

4
00:00:25.977 --> 00:00:27.710
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Thanks for inviting me.

5
00:00:36.608 --> 00:00:39.474
These photos are amazing, Ben.

6
00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.085
You’re really talented.

7
00:00:44.581 --> 00:00:46.615
I love the light in this one.

8
00:00:52.231 --> 00:00:56.553
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Oh, they’re OK.

9
00:00:57.154 --> 00:01:02.700
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> No really, it’s true. You’re a great photographer!

10
00:01:05.404 --> 00:01:06.606
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thanks.

11
00:01:08.686 --> 00:01:12.014
I’d love to see some of your photos, Izzy.

12
00:01:13.424 --> 00:01:18.185
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> Yes. I’d love to see some of your photos, too, Izzy.

13
00:01:19.872 --> 00:01:21.351
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Hi, Andre.

14
00:01:22.414 --> 00:01:24.980
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> Hello, Izzy. How are you?

15
00:01:25.419 --> 00:01:26.574
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I’m great.

16
00:01:28.053 --> 00:01:30.665
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> You still take photographs?

17
00:01:31.127 --> 00:01:35.148
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> When I can. I’m very busy.

18
00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:39.794
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> So, what are you doing these days?

19
00:01:40.117 --> 00:01:43.746
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I’m working…as a bike courier.

20
00:01:45.525 --> 00:01:48.484
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> That’s…interesting.

21
00:01:49.824 --> 00:01:51.673
Yes, I taught Izzy.

22
00:01:52.690 --> 00:02:00.293
She’s very talented – in fact, she was my best student.

23
00:02:00.871 --> 00:02:03.621
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> You were a student at Tensquare, too?

24
00:02:04.869 --> 00:02:06.198
Why didn’t you tell me?

25
00:02:06.244 --> 00:02:09.642
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> Yes. But she didn’t finish the course.

26
00:02:10.878 --> 00:02:15.789
One day she just stopped coming and…didn’t say why.

27
00:02:18.216 --> 00:02:20.897
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I never stopped taking photographs.

28
00:02:21.417 --> 00:02:25.045
But now I take them for me, and not for other people.

29
00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:27.680
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> And how is that going for you?

30
00:02:36.924 --> 00:02:45.614
It’s true. She was my best student and now she’s working as a bike courier.

31
00:02:47.186 --> 00:02:49.035
What a pity.

32
00:02:51.623 --> 00:02:53.842
Have a look at her photos.

33
00:03:02.948 --> 00:03:04.889
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Izzy!